    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d72-a3">

                <pb facs="0223" n="89" sameAs="frus:frus1888p1/pg89"/>

                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Chiantla</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1887-10-30"><hi rendition="#italic">October</hi> 30,
                        1887</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p rendition="#flush"><hi rendition="#italic">To the President:</hi></p>
                <p>At this moment, 6 a.m. ex-Col. Vicente Castañeda, ex-Lieuts. Ismael Diaz and José
                    Muñoz, and ex-Sublieuts. Matias Cifuentes and Francisco Alonzo, convicted of
                    military sedition, have been executed with the formalities of the law.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Luis
                        Molina.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
